2026-07-24T14:18:42.3259483Z               "message": "Make the API new-tab arrow indicator clearly visible\n\nThe ↗ indicator was rendered at 0.72em with 0.75 opacity, making it very\nfaint. Render it at full opacity and 0.9em (inheriting the bright accent\ncolour) so the \"opens in a new tab\" cue is legible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015QvoXY3GYdRayQzh6a6JPv",
